OL,3,GNEWSANo more 'missing link' as new
OL,4,Aroute opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers can now use the A417's
OL,7,Flong-awaited missing link route, after
OL,8,Fyears of disruption.
OL,10,FA new road layout between Gloucester
OL,11,Fand Cirencester has opened as part of a
OL,12,F#500m project designed to ease
OL,13,Fcongestion and improve journey safety.
OL,15,FIt is the first time drivers can travel
OL,16,Falong the A417, which connects the M5
OL,17,Fand M4, without having to negotiate a
OL,18,Fbusy roundabout.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
