OL,3,GNEWSANo more 'missing link' as new
OL,4,Aroute opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Collicott, a motorist from
OL,7,FTewkesbury, said the route was a
OL,8,F"fantastic piece of engineering" which
OL,9,Fallowed cars to "flow straight through
OL,10,Fwithout any delays or diversions".
